('real-m-stripes-source.jpeg','stripes',O('Slanted three-stripe mark followed by a dark M',[230,200,800,390],'Three parallel diagonal bands at left lead into a broad angular M on the right','Intentional dry-brush edges and streaks',[E('stripes','Three parallel forward-slanted broad strokes','left','blue/dark blue/red','Uneven brush ends and rough edges'),E('letterform','Wide angular M','right','dark gray','Two diagonal interior notches and broad block strokes')],[('M','right')],['Fine brush texture is small in this source'])),
