('real-shark-source.jpeg','shark',O('Orange shark silhouette constructed from SHARK letterforms',[170,240,830,410],'Head at left, pointed fin above center, tail at right; letters form the body','Solid orange shapes',[E('shark','Long horizontal fish outline made of letters','center','orange','Pointed snout, dorsal fin, lower fin and forked tail'),E('letterforms','SHARK integrated into animal shape','inside silhouette','orange','Tall central letter strokes follow the body outline')],[('SHARK','inside fish')])),
