('real-black-source.jpeg','black',O('Spaced BLACK wordmark with a red angular A',[300,410,750,530],'Single horizontal line of geometric capitals; red center A has no horizontal crossbar','Clean solid geometry',[E('wordmark','Wide minimal geometric letters','center','dark gray/red','Rounded B/C corners and angular K; A is a red chevron-like open triangle')],[('BLACK','one row')],['Dark letter contrast and exact gray shade are limited by the black shirt'])),
